Deployment

Integration Steps:
Collaborate with hospital IT to connect the AI model with the EHR system.
Develop APIs or interfaces for real-time risk scoring.
Implement user-friendly dashboards for clinicians to view risk predictions.
Set up monitoring for model performance and data drift.
Train staff on interpreting and using model outputs.
Compliance with Healthcare Regulations:
Ensure all patient data is encrypted both at rest and in transit.
Implement strict access controls and audit trails.
Conduct regular privacy impact assessments.
Follow HIPAA guidelines for data handling and patient consent.

Optimization

Addressing Overfitting:
Use techniques such as cross-validation and regularization (e.g., L1/L2 penalties) to prevent overfitting and improve generalization.
